  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8003.03 Testing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8003.03 Testing. All new applicants shall successfully pass a written test with a score of at least 70% relevant to the educational requirements, including NFPA 54, National Fuel Gas Code, set forth in each of the specialty licenses listed in Saf-C 8004.\n\nSource. #8954, eff 7-21-07; ss by #9542, eff 9-10-09",
